 UTC Nov 6 of the Gushenxing-2 rocket from Jiuquan on its second launch, reaching orbit successfully for the first time.", "url": "https://x.com/planet4589/status/2118864092064632920"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:23:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118861761386516786"], "id": "2118861761386516786", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10264, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "SpaceX will deploy another batch of satellites for a clandestine U.S. Space Force program on a Falcon 9 rocket launch from California. Liftoff is scheduled for 4:48 p.m. PST (7:48 p.m. EST / 0048 UTC). Watch live coverage: https://t.co/DmJWIoyBX8", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2118861761386516786"}, {"author_id": "34743251", "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:06:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118857663106707757"], "id": "2118857663106707757", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 120, "impression_count": 712756, "like_count": 5523, "quote_count": 44, "reply_count": 240, "retweet_count": 606}, "text": "All systems are looking good, and weather is favorable for liftoff. Propellant load is about to begin for Falcon 9’s launch of the USSF-432 mission from California → https://t.co/71Loda4Pvi https://t.co/aV6LN3ET3N", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2118857663106707757"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:02:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118840871932358819", "2118841460791644434"], "id": "2118841460791644434", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 35, "impression_count": 354124, "like_count": 748, "quote_count": 17, "reply_count": 85, "retweet_count": 101}, "text": "LIVE: President Donald J. Trump provides remarks to kick off MAX POWER—America’s newest aerospace expo and air show, taking place Nov. 7-8 @NASAKennedy: https://t.co/iX2v6vtTdQ https://t.co/VsbruOeJ9d", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2118841460791644434"}, {"author_id": "11348282", 